  lines:
  - speakerName: The Architect
    text: The Harvester collects into its output buffer. A conveyor carries those
      particles to Maxwell's Demon automatically. Open the conveyor tool, then tap
      the tile beside the Harvester's output to set the start. Tap the tile in front
      of the Demon's input and I will route the belt for you. Tap the check to place
      it, then Finished when you are done.
